    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba0996adc52ebf17",
      "translationZh": "完整的子领域计数位于 manifest.json 的 domain_subdomain 下。筛选只需：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "196360f85d4c1827",
      "translationZh": "3.07M 个样本是单轮对话，698k 个是多轮对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53cf52c8560d7b85",
      "translationZh": "我首先想指出的是校准部分。antihal 加上 antihal_kb_refined 和 selfcheck，大约共有 681k 个样本，内容涉及模型说明自己的知识边界、审查错误前提，或在中途发现自身错误并加以纠正。小模型尤其容易出现这类问题，因此在这些部分投入了大量精力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8125f5a27157f4",
      "translationZh": "selfcheck 细分为 12 种具体的错误类型，而不是归入一个笼统的类别：catch_logical_jump、catch_wrong_assumption、catch_terminology_confusion、catch_orientation_error、catch_correlation_causation、catch_unit_error、catch_missing_constraint、catch_arithmetic_slip、catch_overgeneralization、catch_off_by_one、catch_premise_misread、catch_scope_creep",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04c2884f2cc22f06",
      "translationZh": "工具调用链并非模拟生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f80d9836f57658e",
      "translationZh": "tool_use 和 tool_use_complex 中共有 279k 个工具调用样本。其中，87,162 个由一个执行框架生成，该框架实际运行了每个工具，并将真实结果粘贴回对话记录中。模型始终只围绕提供给它的结果撰写推理内容，这意味着在这些样本中，编造工具输出在结构上就不可能发生，而不只是受到抑制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb642259a3e26c72",
      "translationZh": "每个样本平均包含 4.2 次工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd2fa817a56aeac0",
      "translationZh": "其中 100% 都包含真实的失败以及从失败中恢复的过程，而不是一路顺利的理想流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f0e8caafc181310",
      "translationZh": "如果你只想要这些样本，请按 metadata.subdomain == \"multi_step_real_execution\" 进行筛选。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
